stream
BT /F2 22 Tf 40 540 Td (Banana pancakes) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 518 Td (About 8 small pancakes. 10 minutes to mix, 15 at the stove.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 40 488 Td (Ingredients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 470 Td (2 ripe bananas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 455 Td (2 eggs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 440 Td (150 ml milk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 425 Td (100 g plain flour) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 410 Td (1 tsp baking powder and a pinch of salt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 395 Td (Butter for the pan, maple syrup to serve) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 40 370 Td (Method) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 352 Td (1. Mash the bananas, then whisk in the eggs and the milk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 337 Td (2. Stir in the flour, baking powder and salt until just combined.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 322 Td (3. Butter a pan over a medium heat and pour in small ladlefuls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 307 Td (4. Cook for 2 minutes, until bubbles show, then flip for a minute more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 292 Td (5. Serve warm, with maple syrup.) Tj ET
endstream
